Generate a standalone C reproducer that triggers this vulnerability:

File: libtiff/tif_dirinfo.c
Line: 685
Function: _TIFFPrintFieldInfo
Bug type: null-pointer-dereference
CWE: CWE-476
Explanation: fprintf is called with "%s" and fip->field_name, but anonymous fields created by _TIFFCreateAnonField() have field_name == NULL. Passing a NULL pointer to "%s" is undefined behavior and can crash. This occurs when printing a directory that contains such anonymous fields.

